WEBVTT

00:00:00.105 --> 00:00:10.329
This video shows how to create classes and sections on your phone. You will first create the master classes, and then the sections for the current academic year.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:24.101
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Management, and then choose Classes. Classes come in two kinds, master classes and session classes, and we will create both.

00:00:26.919 --> 00:00:39.783
First switch to Master. Tap Class, choose the grade level, check the suggested name, and save without sections. A master class is simply the name of a grade, like Class 6.

00:00:42.507 --> 00:00:51.915
Repeat this once for each grade your school has. Master classes are shared across all academic years, so you only create them once.

00:00:53.676 --> 00:01:05.172
Now switch to Session Classes, which belong to the active academic year. Tap Add Session Class, choose the master class, and create sections such as A and B.

00:01:10.418 --> 00:01:16.274
Your classes and sections are ready. Next, you can add students to them.
